			<div class="content" id="post-content-3930028">
									

<p>I want to thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luk9gamer10" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4519073); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4519073&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1577768342" alt="Luk9gamer10" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4519073)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luk9gamer10" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4519073); return false;">Luk9gamer10</a></span>, <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Zyn who I am now realizing didn't actually critique it</span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyii" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4420424); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4420424&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1577768342" alt="keyii" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4420424)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyii" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4420424); return false;">keyii</a></span> for their feedback during the creation of this article; they were truly indispensable.</p>
<p>I’d always thought about the aura of majestic dread surrounding the Yellowstone Volcano and decided to put a name to that dread — SCP-4997! A lot of research went into this SCP and all the images were homemade, so there’s no copyright to worry about. If you feel the need to downvote, let me know what drove you to it.</p>
<p>I hope you all enjoy it!</p>
<p><strong>Bonus:</strong> Thank you so much to <strong><a href="https://www.reddit.com/user/jeandepain/">u/jeandepain</a></strong> on Reddit for their amazing fan art which can be found <strong><a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/SCP/comments/ci1osw/imminent_breach_at_yellowstone_national_park/">here</a></strong>! Don't forget <strong><a href="https://www.deviantart.com/toonholt">ToonHolt</a></strong>'s fan art of 4997 <strong><a href="https://www.deviantart.com/toonholt/art/Monsterverse-Tephradon-821310510">here</a></strong> too!</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Although the actual appearance is never described in-depth I wrote this with the image of a <a href="https://xenoblade.fandom.com/wiki/Colubrim">Colubrim</a> in mind but you're free to interpret the text as you wish, especially since I like ToonHolt's iteration a lot more than my base concept, ily guys.</span></p>

